  "abstract": "An 89-year-old man presented with changes in cognition and personality. Six months earlier, he began to require help managing his finances and operating his computer. His family observed that he had a poor memory for recent events and found it difficult to express himself. During the next few months, he became increasingly irritable and began to engage in some unusual behaviors, . . .",
